    },
    {
      "title": "Remove the rewind lever and power dial",
      "intro": "Removing the circlip is best done with some fine circlip pliers, but if you don't have these it can be carefully levered off using a small screwdriver. Be careful removing the power switch because there are fine contacts that are easily damaged.",
      "substeps": [
        {
          "text": "Open the back of the camera, put something in the winding fork to jam it and unscrew the winder",
          "bulletStyle": "red"
        },
        {
          "text": "Remove the circlip from around the central plastic column",
          "bulletStyle": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": "Be careful removing the power switch because there are fine contacts that are easily damaged",
          "bulletStyle": "caution"
        }
      ],
