    },
    {
      "title": "Remove the wind lever",
      "intro": "It is best to try and use friction to unscrew this (normal threaded, turn anti-clockwise) without damaging it. There are two holes to use a spanning wrench, however the plate is thin and easily damaged by too much force.",
      "substeps": [
        {
          "text": "Remove the top plate from the wind lever using friction",
          "bulletStyle": "green"
        }
      ],
      "photos": [
        {
          "filename": "41c014.jpg",
          "alt": "",
          "annotations": [
            {
              "type": "arrow",
              "x1": 0.43872522719581347,
              "y1": 0.6803428585646218,
              "x2": 0.510569454647506,
              "y2": 0.5720612567333889,
              "substep": 0
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Remove the top cover",
      "intro": "The top cover should now be able to be removed. It is connected via wires to the internals of the camera. If you are going to do more to the camera then these wires are best unsoldered. There is a blue wire with two cores - this is connected to a second wire that is in turn connected to the flash mount. Do not unsolder it directly from the flash mount because it is easy to melt the plastic mount.",
      "substeps": [
        {
          "text": "Unsolder the yellow wire",
          "bulletStyle": "yellow"
        },
        {
          "text": "Unsolder the green wire",
          "bulletStyle": "green"
        },
        {
          "text": "Unsolder the red wire",
          "bulletStyle": "red"
        },
        {
          "text": "Unsolder the second yellow wire. It is soldered along with another wire - reattach the other one so you don't forget where it goes",
          "bulletStyle": "orange"
        },
        {
          "text": "Unsolder the blue wire",
          "bulletStyle": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": "Pull the connection on the blue wire out from the plastic tube and unsolder it",
          "bulletStyle": "cyan"
        },
        {
          "text": "Do not unsolder directly from the flash mount - it is easy to melt the plastic",
          "bulletStyle": "caution"
        }
      ],
